{"item_uid": "指考101-physics-001", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 1, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "一孤立在空氣中的點波源，發出固定頻率的聲波，每週期輸出的平均功率不變。假\n設聲波能量沒有轉換為其他形式的能量，則對於球心均位於點波源，但半徑分別為\nR 與 2R 的甲、乙兩個球面而言，下列敘述何者正確？", "options": {"A": "在甲、乙兩球面處的聲波波長比為1:2", "B": "在甲、乙兩球面處的聲波波長比為2:1", "C": "每週期內通過甲、乙兩球面的聲波總能量相等", "D": "甲、乙兩球面單位面積通過的聲波能量，彼此相等", "E": "甲、乙兩球面單位面積通過的聲波能量，其比為2:1"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 55.0, "D": 21.0, "E": 13.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 2.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 77.0, "D": 13.0, "E": 8.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 10.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 36.0, "D": 26.0, "E": 15.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 55.0, "p_high": 77.0, "p_low": 36.0, "discrimination": 41.0, "p_quintiles": [85.0, 63.0, 53.0, 43.0, 33.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-physics-002", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 2, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "一個連續週期繩波向 x的方向傳播， 位移(cm)\n如圖 1 所示，若細繩上的各質點在原\n位置每分鐘上下振盪 12 次，則下列敘\n述何者正確？ 位置(cm)", "options": {"A": "此週期波的波長為15cm", "B": "此週期波的振幅為4cm 圖 1", "C": "此週期波的頻率為12Hz", "D": "此週期波的波速為2.4cm/s", "E": "此週期波由位置3cm 處傳播到27cm處需時18s"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 1.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 81.0, "E": 2.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 96.0, "E": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 2.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 58.0, "E": 4.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 81.0, "p_high": 96.0, "p_low": 58.0, "discrimination": 38.0, "p_quintiles": [98.0, 94.0, 89.0, 80.0, 46.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-physics-003", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 3, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "在一條沿 x軸拉緊的均勻細繩上，有甲與乙 y\n兩個脈波，以波速 v分別向右與向左行進，\nv\n當時間 t 0時，兩波的波形如圖 2 所示。圖\n甲\n中的兩個三角形均為等腰，且高度 H 遠小於 H L\nx\n底邊的長度 L（未依比例繪製）。若重力的 L 0 乙\n-H\n影響可忽略不計，則下列有關這兩個脈波的 v\n敘述，何者正確？ 圖 2", "options": {"A": "位於甲、乙兩脈波上的小段細繩均沿 x方向運動", "B": "位於甲、乙兩脈波上的小段細繩，其動能均為零", "C": "當兩脈波完全重疊的瞬間，細繩成一直線", "D": "當兩脈波完全重疊的瞬間，繩波動能為零", "E": "當兩脈波完全重疊後，繩波就永遠消失\n- 1 -\n101年指考 第 2 頁\n物理考科 共 7 頁"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 86.0, "D": 7.0, "E": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 99.0, "D": 1.0, "E": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 9.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 65.0, "D": 17.0, "E": 3.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 86.0, "p_high": 99.0, "p_low": 65.0, "discrimination": 34.0, "p_quintiles": [99.0, 98.0, 95.0, 84.0, 54.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-physics-004", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 4, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "2009年諾貝爾物理獎的一半是頒發給科學家高錕，以表彰他對光纖應用的貢獻。下\n列有關光纖的敘述，何者正確？", "options": {"A": "光在光纖中傳播是利用全反射原理", "B": "光纖傳播光訊號是利用光電效應", "C": "光纖傳播光訊號容易受到周圍環境電磁波的影響", "D": "光纖僅能傳播由雷射光源所產生的光波", "E": "光纖軸心部分的折射率較其外圍部分的折射率小"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 86.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 1.0, "E": 6.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 99.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 0.0, "D": 0.0, "E": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 63.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 5.0, "D": 3.0, "E": 15.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 86.0, "p_high": 99.0, "p_low": 63.0, "discrimination": 36.0, "p_quintiles": [100.0, 99.0, 96.0, 85.0, 50.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-physics-005", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 5, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "有一質量為 m、比熱為 s的金屬小珠子自高處靜止落下，由於空氣阻力的緣故，珠子\n落地前以等速度 v 下降。假設空氣對珠子的阻力所導致的熱全部由珠子吸收，而不\n考慮珠子的熱散失，令重力加速度為 g，且所有物理量均採 SI 制，則在珠子落地前\n以等速度 v 下降時，珠子的溫度每單位時間升高多少？\ngv gv mv gs v", "options": {"A": "", "B": "", "C": "", "D": "", "E": "ms s gs v gs"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 18.0, "B": 60.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 6.0, "E": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 4.0, "B": 92.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 1.0, "E": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 31.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 12.0, "E": 7.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 60.0, "p_high": 92.0, "p_low": 25.0, "discrimination": 67.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 82.0, 62.0, 38.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-physics-006", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 6, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "有一汽車輪胎，內含約 10公升的空氣，胎內空氣可視為理想氣體。已知胎內壓力比\n胎外壓力約多 3個大氣壓。假設輪胎內外溫度皆等於室溫（ 300K），且取波茲曼常\n數 k 1.381023 J/K，1 大氣 壓1.01105 N/m2，則該輪胎內約有多少個氣體分子？\n（已知外界大氣壓力為一大氣壓）", "options": {"A": "1010", "B": "1020", "C": "1024", "D": "1028", "E": "1030"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 51.0, "D": 32.0, "E": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 73.0, "D": 21.0, "E": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 4.0, "B": 18.0, "C": 33.0, "D": 37.0, "E": 8.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 51.0, "p_high": 73.0, "p_low": 33.0, "discrimination": 40.0, "p_quintiles": [80.0, 59.0, 47.0, 39.0, 30.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-physics-007", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 7, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "某生用白光光源做「干涉與繞射」實驗，以同一雙狹縫干涉的裝置進行三次實驗時，\n將雙狹縫分別以僅可通過紅色、藍色、綠色的單色濾光片遮蓋，則使用不同顏色濾\n光片所產生干涉條紋的間距，由大至小排列為下列何者？", "options": {"A": "紅、藍、綠", "B": "紅、綠、藍", "C": "藍、綠、紅", "D": "綠、紅、藍", "E": "藍、紅、綠"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 5.0, "B": 75.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 1.0, "E": 1.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 95.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 0.0, "E": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 10.0, "B": 52.0, "C": 33.0, "D": 3.0, "E": 3.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 75.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 52.0, "discrimination": 43.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 90.0, 78.0, 65.0, 44.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-physics-008", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 8, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "考慮可視為質點的甲、乙兩原子，甲固定於原點，乙只在 x軸上運動，乙受甲的原子\n力 F只與距離 x有關，且 F以沿 x方向為正，F與 x的關係，在 2.21010mx5.01010m\n間如圖 3 所示。乙由靜止自 P點開始移動，假設乙除原子力 F 外不受其他外力作用，\n則下列敘述何者正確？\nF (1012N)\n6.0\n3.0\nR\n0 x (1010m)\nP Q\n-3.0\n-6.0\n1.5 2.0 2.5 3.0 3.5 4.0 4.5 5.0\n圖3", "options": {"A": "乙原子到達Q 點時，動能最大", "B": "乙原子到達R點時，動能最大", "C": "乙原子到達Q 點後便靜止於該處", "D": "乙原子到達R點後便靜止於該處", "E": "乙原子到達R點時，速度一定指向 x方向\n- 2 -\n第 3 頁 101年指考\n共 7 頁 物理考科"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 62.0, "B": 17.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 4.0, "E": 10.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 90.0, "B": 5.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 1.0, "E": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 32.0, "B": 31.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 8.0, "E": 18.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 62.0, "p_high": 90.0, "p_low": 32.0, "discrimination": 58.0, "p_quintiles": [94.0, 82.0, 65.0, 46.0, 24.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-physics-009", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 9, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "一輛小貨車的質量為 2000公斤，在車輪不打滑的情況下，以等速度爬一坡度為 7的\n公路斜坡，若空氣阻力與機件引起的力學能損失皆可忽略，取重力加速度為 10m/s2，\nsin70.12，而引擎輸出功率固定為 80000瓦特，則小貨車的速率約為多少公里/小時？", "options": {"A": "60", "B": "80", "C": "90", "D": "100", "E": "120"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 13.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 11.0, "E": 43.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 6.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 6.0, "E": 77.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 20.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 15.0, "E": 15.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 43.0, "p_high": 77.0, "p_low": 15.0, "discrimination": 62.0, "p_quintiles": [86.0, 58.0, 36.0, 21.0, 12.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-physics-010", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 10, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "已知月球表面的重力加速度為地球表面重力加速度 g的六分之一。在月球的水平面\n上有一質量為 m的物體受水平推力 F作用，而作加速度為 2g的等加速度運動，已知\n物體與水平面之動摩擦係數為 0.5，則推力 F的量值為下列何者？\n5 25 23 5", "options": {"A": "mg", "B": "mg", "C": "mg", "D": "mg", "E": "2mg\n2 12 12 6"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 68.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 9.0, "E": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 95.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 0.0, "E": 0.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 11.0, "B": 35.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 24.0, "E": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 68.0, "p_high": 95.0, "p_low": 35.0, "discrimination": 60.0, "p_quintiles": [97.0, 90.0, 78.0, 50.0, 28.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-physics-011", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 11, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "一內壁光滑的環形細圓管，鉛直的固定於一基座頂部的水平\n表面上，環的半徑為 r，細管的內徑遠小於 r 而可忽略。在\n圓管中有一質量為 m 的質點，能繞行圓管作完整的圓周運\n動，已知當質點經過最低點時的速率為 v ，如圖 4 所示。則 r\n0\n該質點通過圓管的最低點與最高點時，圓管施於基座頂部的\n力，其鉛直分量相差多少？\n2mv2 2mv2 mv2 v", "options": {"A": "0 4mg", "B": "0 4mg", "C": "0 0\nr r r 基座\n2mv2", "D": "0", "E": "0\nr 圖4"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 30.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 13.0, "D": 17.0, "E": 17.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 48.0, "B": 19.0, "C": 12.0, "D": 11.0, "E": 10.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 19.0, "B": 26.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 20.0, "E": 20.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 30.0, "p_high": 48.0, "p_low": 19.0, "discrimination": 29.0, "p_quintiles": [57.0, 32.0, 22.0, 20.0, 19.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "指考101-physics-012", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "指考", "year_roc": 101, "year_ce": 2012, "subject_key": "physics", "subject_zh": "物理", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 12, "join_excluded": false, "part": "第壹部分：選擇題（占80分）", "stem": "甲、乙為質量相等的兩質點，在光滑水平面上以同一速率 v，沿著不同方向分別作等\n速度運動。隨後它們彼此碰撞而結合成一體，並以速率 v/2 沿 x 軸方向前進。已知\n在過程中外力的合力為零，則甲質點在碰撞前的運動方向與 x 軸的夾角是多少？", "options": {"A": "0", "B": "30", "C": "45", "D": "60", "E": "90"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": null, "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": null, "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 4.0, "B": 11.0, "C": 20.0, "D": 60.0, "E": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 84.0, "E": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 31.0, "D": 32.0, "E": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 60.0, "p_high": 84.0, "p_low": 32.0, "discrimination": 52.0, "p_quintiles": [90.0, 75.0, 62.0, 46.0, 25.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
